From: adman234 fork <noreply@github.com>
Date: Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0058: Parakeet (onnx-asr, CPU) transcription backend

TRANSCRIBE_BACKEND=parakeet transcribes with NVIDIA Parakeet TDT through
onnx-asr on the CPU (no VRAM). The language the caller supplies (Bazarr's
?language=, media metadata) is always used; WHISPER_MODEL only detects a
missing language and handles languages Parakeet cannot. Both models unload
with the existing CLEAR_VRAM_ON_COMPLETE / MODEL_CLEANUP_DELAY cleanup.
Also makes patch 0002's startup model load opt-in (EAGER_MODEL_LOAD).

